    {
      "text": "I may prove them, whether they will walk in my law, Ex. 16:4. God is come to prove you, Ex. 20:20. through them I may prove Israel, Judg. 2:22. my God, that thou triest the heart, 1 Chr. 29:17 (Ps. 7:9; Prov. 17:3; Jer. 11:20; 1 Thes. 2:4). when he hath tried me, I shall come forth as gold, Job 23:10. Lord trieth the righteous, Ps. 11:5 (Jer. 20:12). know my heart: try me, Ps. 139:23. try them as gold is tried, Zech. 13:9. Bring ye all the tithes … and prove me, Mal. 3:10.",
